id: pm-rl-empty-author
title: Reconcile the empty-author transaction contract with native SDK behavior
description: "The release gate test for an invalid transaction author expects runRlLoop to reject an empty coordinates author. On untouched PR head cd91de9 it instead completes, causing Missing expected rejection. Reconcile the intended public validation contract with the pinned SDK; preserve infrastructure errors and avoid recording them as promotion refusals. This blocker is outside the seven requested PR 107 review fixes."
