comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-30T17:10:46.795Z",codex-agent,"Original-head control: cd91de9, sanitized child identity, a real standalone SDK tracker, one test worker. Result: 1 test, 0 pass, 1 failure, Missing expected rejection at test/loop.test.ts:833. The current review integration attempt has the same failed assertion. Determine whether explicit package author validation is intended or whether the test reflects an outdated SDK assumption; do not silently turn infrastructure failures into evaluation refusals."
  "2026-10-31T00:29:16.101Z",codex-agent,"The invalid-author probe now passes 1/1. runRlLoop rejects an empty transaction author before programme discovery or allocation. The regression compares the complete real SDK item list before and after, proving no candidate or promotion-refusal record is created. This strengthens the old late-failure assertion; the original cd91de9 control failed with Missing expected rejection."
